NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for small businesses in Merthyr Tydfil and across the South Wales Valleys. Every logo is designed from scratch — no AI, no templates, no shortcuts.

> "Your logo is the first thing customers notice. A strong identity builds trust before you've said a word."

## Why Merthyr Tydfil businesses invest in professional logos

In a competitive local market, first impressions matter. Whether a potential customer finds you on Google, sees your van driving past, or lands on your website, a professional logo signals that you take your business seriously. A poorly designed logo — or no logo at all — tells people the opposite.

We've worked with businesses right across Merthyr Tydfil, and the ones with consistent, professional branding consistently make stronger first impressions and win more of the customers they're after.

## Our work in Merthyr Tydfil

We've designed logos and brand identities for businesses based in Merthyr Tydfil, including:

- **[AK Promotions](/portfolio/ak-promotions/)** — a complete brand identity for this local promotions company, built into their website from day one
- **[What's On Merthyr Tydfil](/portfolio/whats-on-merthyr-tydfil/)** — logo and visual identity for the community events platform serving Merthyr Tydfil residents

Both projects involved creating a consistent visual identity that works across their websites, social media, and print materials.

## What's included in our logo design service

Every project includes:

- 5 initial logo concepts covering different styles and directions
- Revisions on your chosen concept until you're completely happy
- Brand colour palette — primary and secondary colours chosen to work together
- Typography — font pairings that complement your logo
- Brand guidelines document — so you use your brand consistently across everything
- All file formats: PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG — ready for web, print, and signage

See our full [logo design service](/services/logo-design/) for everything that's included.

## No AI. Designed by hand.

Every logo we create is drawn using Adobe Illustrator — no AI-generated artwork, no stock icon libraries, no generic templates. Your logo is unique to your business and designed with intention.

## Pair it with your website

If you need a website alongside your logo, we build them together — so your brand colours, fonts, and identity are consistent from day one. Take a look at our [web design service](/services/web-design/) or [view our portfolio](/portfolio/) to see examples of sites we've built for Merthyr Tydfil businesses.

## Frequently asked questions

**How much does logo design cost?**

Get in touch for a tailored quote — pricing depends on the scope of the project. We offer transparent, fixed-price packages with no hidden costs.

**How long does it take?**

Most logo projects are completed within 5–10 days, depending on how quickly feedback is provided.

**Will I own the logo?**

Yes. Full ownership of all files and designs is transferred to you on completion.

**Do you only work with Merthyr Tydfil businesses?**

No — we work with businesses across South Wales and beyond. But we're particularly well-placed to help local Merthyr Tydfil businesses, having already built a track record here.

**Can you also design my website?**

Yes. We offer [web design](/services/web-design/) and [web development](/services/web-development/) services alongside logo design, so your new identity can be built into a new website from the start.

See all our [web design Merthyr Tydfil services](/web-design-merthyr-tydfil/).
